Legend: ✅ live · 🟡 partial/in-progress · ⬜ not started.

## Top roadmap priorities (implied)
1. Finish the **Company OS shell** — persistent app shell with all priority workspaces wired
   (Executive, Marketplace, Customers, Suppliers, Operations, Knowledge, AI, Documents, Analytics,
   AI Departments). Backend `fn_ws_*` already exists.
2. **AI Project Consultant** (NL project → multi-RFQ decomposition) for enterprise procurement.
