# API_REFERENCE

Two API layers: (1) **Edge Function HTTP endpoints** (`/functions/v1/<name>`), and (2) **Postgres
RPC functions** (`fn_*`) that Edge Functions call. Business RPCs are listed here; pgvector/pg_trgm
internal functions are omitted. Audited 2026-07-06.

## Base
- URL: `https://htdblwldjkcgjvmqkbeh.supabase.co/functions/v1/<function>`
- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <supabase_access_token>` for JWT-gated functions.

---

## os_api action protocol (Company OS)
`POST /functions/v1/os_api` with `{ "action": "<name>", ... }`. Owner/admin only.

| action | returns | backed by |
|---|---|---|
| `ping` | `{ok,user}` | — (auth probe) |
| `dashboard` | command-center rollup | `fn_os_command()` |
| `nav` | nav badge counts | `fn_os_nav()` |
| `ws.exec` | executive workspace | `fn_ws_exec()` |
| `ws.marketplace` | RFQs/quotes/pipeline | `fn_ws_marketplace()` |
| `ws.customers` | customers 360 | `fn_ws_customers()` |
| `ws.suppliers` | directory (params: q/emirate/sector/approval/limit/offset) | `fn_ws_suppliers(p jsonb)` |
| `ws.operations` | approvals/decisions/tasks | `fn_ws_operations()` |
| `ws.ai` | agents/actions/runs | `fn_ws_ai()` |
| `ws.knowledge` | KB/legal/specs | `fn_ws_knowledge()` |
| `ws.documents` | files/reviews | `fn_ws_documents()` |
| `ws.analytics` | marketplace + funnel | `fn_ws_analytics()` |
| `ws.company` | AI departments | `fn_ws_company()` |
| `search` | global search (params: q) | `fn_os_search(p_q)` |
| `record` | record detail (params: entity,id) | `fn_os_record(entity,id)` |

---

## Business RPC functions (by domain)

### Decision & governance engine
- `fn_decide(...)` — unified decision engine entrypoint.
- `fn_ai_gate(...)` — AI action gate (approve / block / hold-for-review).
- `fn_should_escalate(...)` — escalation decision per `decision_policy`.
- `fn_authorize(...)` / `fn_role_of(email)` — RBAC/ABAC authorization & role resolution.
- `fn_rules_eval(...)` — evaluates `business_rules` (when/then).
- `fn_require_grounding(...)` — enforces RAG grounding (hard gate via `ai_grounding_hard_gate` flag).
- `fn_flag(key)` — feature flag check. `fn_simulate(...)` — operational simulator.

### Marketplace & matching
- `match_suppliers(...)` / `match_suppliers_kw(...)` — vector + keyword supplier matching for an RFQ.
- `fn_rfq_score(...)` — RFQ quality/completeness scoring. `playbook_for(category)` — qualification.
- `quote_gate(...)` / `fn_quote_structured_score(...)` / `fn_quality_metrics()` — quote quality gate.
- `fn_quote_coaching(...)` — supplier quote-improvement coaching.
- `fn_price_confidence(category, amount)` — price confidence band (median/p25/p75/n).
- `fn_supplier_capability_score(...)` / `fn_twin(...)` — capability score & digital twin.
- `recompute_supplier_rating(...)` / `qd_recompute_response(...)` — ratings & response rate.
- `reveal_fee(...)` / `margin_rate(...)` / `registered_supplier_count()` — pricing helpers.
- `mask_contacts(...)` / `scrub_quote_contacts(...)` — anti-leak masking.

### Analytics, health & reporting
- `fn_os_command()` — full command-center rollup (revenue, ops, marketplace, infra, health, attention).
- `fn_health_index()` / `fn_supply_health()` — composite health scores.
- `fn_marketplace_analytics()` — RFQ funnel, response/savings, capacity, category growth.
- `fn_ops_dashboard()` / `fn_ops_metrics()` / `fn_ops_watch()` — operations metrics & watch.
- `fn_data_metrics()`, `fn_funnel`/`funnel_metrics()`, `fn_voice_metrics()`, `fn_strategy_metrics()`,
  `fn_quality_metrics()` — domain metric packs.
- `fn_board_report()`, `fn_founder_brief()`, `fn_period_report()`, `fn_monthly_report()`,
  `fn_quarterly_report()`, `fn_report_skeleton()`, `fn_officer_recs()` — reporting.
- `fn_exception_alerts()` — surfaces anomalies to `founder_alerts`.

### AI agents, knowledge & prompts
- `run_agent(...)` — invoke an agent run. `fn_agent_context(...)` — assembles agent context.
- `fn_resolve_cat_agent(...)` / `ensure_category_agent(...)` — category-agent resolution/creation.
- `fn_memory_search(...)` / `kb_query(...)` / `kb_sync()` — memory & knowledge retrieval/sync.
- `fn_kb_submit_revision()` / `fn_kb_validate()` / `fn_kb_approve()` — knowledge governance.
- `fn_prompt_get()` / `fn_prompt_publish()` / `fn_prompt_rollback()` — prompt registry.
- `fn_eval_run()` / `fn_eval_snapshot()` — AI evaluation harness.

### Documents & versioning
- `fn_register_document(...)` — register a file into `documents`.
- `fn_doc_control()` / `fn_doc_expiry_scan()` / `fn_doc_diff()` / `fn_doc_history()` — doc control.

### Finance & collections
- `fn_collections()` — supplier dues/collections run. `fn_company_facts_sync()` — company facts.

### Security
- `fn_security_scan()` / `fn_run_vt()` — security & VirusTotal scans. `canary_scan()` — honeytokens.
- `is_disposable_email()` / `block_disposable_signup()` — abuse prevention.
- `auth_uid_by_email(email)` — auth lookup helper.

### Experiments
- `fn_experiment_assign()` / `fn_experiment_record()` / `fn_experiment_results()`.

### Cron runners (SQL side; invoked by pg_cron, call Edge Functions via pg_net)
`run_health_check`, `run_auto_deploy`, `run_site_autodeploy`, `run_licence_reminders`,
`run_no_quote_nudges`, `run_pending_digest`, `run_reveal_nudges`, `enqueue_supplier_invites`,
`fn_wa_fanout`, `qd_reveal_nudges`.

---

## Edge endpoint contracts (verified from source)

### `customer_api` (JWT; auto-creates customer) — `{action, ...}`
`me` · `specs` · `detect{text}` · `analyze_drawing{images|original_b64,mime,name,hint}` ·
`analyze_quotation{images,file_name}` · `create_inquiry{category,emirate,summary,spec,budget,
scope_type,trades,drawing}` (requires verified email; 20/hr) · `my_inquiries` ·
`quote_pdf{quote_id,lang}` (40/hr; bilingual) · `reveal{quote_id}` · `confirm_reveal{quote_id,
payment_ref}` · `request_refund{quote_id}` · `rate_supplier{quote_id,rating,comment}` ·
`complete_inquiry{quote_id}` · `close_inquiry{inquiry_id,outcome}` · `cancel_inquiry{inquiry_id}` ·
`supplier_history{quote_id}` · `save_me{full_name,phone}`.

### `inquiry_ai` (JWT; 30/hr) — `{text?, images?[], emirate?}`
Returns `{request_type, category, label, emirate, spec, summary, scope_type, trades[], compliance[],
missing[], confidence, agent, needs_more}`. Two-stage (sourcing brief → category-expert estimator
gate). Multimodal. OpenRouter model ladder opus-4.8 → sonnet-4.6 → gpt-4o.

### `route_inquiry` (inbound_secret) — `{inquiry_id | inquiry}`
Returns `{ok, job_type:''single''|''multi'', primary_trade, reasoning, fits:[{id,company_name,reason}],
evaluated, retrieval}`. Hybrid retrieval (gte-small vector + kw) → LLM fit adjudication.

### `agent_act` (inbound_secret OR admin JWT+MFA) — `{action:''chat''|''confirm'', agent, message,
history?, action_id?, proposal?}`
`chat` → `{reply, proposal?}`; `confirm` → executes one whitelisted action (see EDGE_FUNCTIONS.md).

### `stripe_webhook` (Stripe HMAC) — Stripe event JSON
Handles `checkout.session.completed` → creates `transactions`, flips to `revealed`, notifies supplier.

### Confirmed LLM/model facts
All inference via **OpenRouter**; preferred model ladder **`claude-opus-4.8` → `claude-sonnet-4.6`
→ `gpt-4o`** (agent chat uses sonnet-4.6). Embeddings via in-function `Supabase.ai` `gte-small`
(384-d). These supersede any generic "Gemini/OpenRouter" phrasing elsewhere — both keys exist but
OpenRouter+Claude is the primary path in the functions read.

> Full triggers list in `AUTOMATIONS.md`. When adding an RPC, document it here.
'),
