('_global','Asset text: SECURITY.md',45,'From company asset "SECURITY.md" (Dropbox: /QuotesDone Backup/Assets/QuotesDone_OS_Docs/SECURITY.md)

# SECURITY

Audited 2026-07-06. Security is enforced at the database boundary and hardened repeatedly across
migrations (`prelaunch_security_hardening`, `security_hardening_rls`, `harden_rls_*`,
`tighten_grants_and_add_fk_indexes`, `rbac_abac_policy_v2`, `hardening_phase1_schema`).

## 1. Data access model — RLS default-deny
Every one of the ~110 public tables has **Row-Level Security enabled**, and there is essentially no
permissive policy for anon/authenticated roles (audit found 1 policy total). Practical effect:
direct client access to tables is denied. **All data access goes through Edge Functions using the
service-role key**, and each function enforces its own authorization. This is the core security
guarantee — a leaked anon key cannot read business data.

## 2. Identity & roles (RBAC + ABAC)
- Roles (`roles`): `owner`, `admin`, `ops`, `finance`, `support`, `supplier`, `customer`, `agent`,
  `guest`. Assignments in `user_roles`.
- `fn_role_of(email)` resolves a caller''s role; `fn_authorize(...)` + `role_permissions`
  (`constraint_json`) provide attribute-based checks (ABAC). Migration `rbac_abac_policy_v2`.
- Admin config `admin_emails` in `app_secrets` is a secondary allow-list for owner/admin surfaces.

## 3. Admin MFA
Admin/owner surfaces (`/crm`, `/admin`, `/os`) require an MFA session (`admin_mfa_sessions`:
`session_id`, `verified_at`, `expires_at`, `ip`). Admin MFA phone stored as `admin_mfa_phone`.

## 4. Authentication hardening
- Email/password via Supabase Auth; verification via `email_verifications`, `phone_verifications`,
  `customer_phone_otps`, Twilio Verify (`twilio_verify_service_sid`), and voice OTP.
- **Anti-abuse:** disposable-email blocking (`is_disposable_email`, `block_disposable_signup`,
  `app_blocked_domains`), email suppression list (`email_suppressions`), signup fraud guard
  (`fraud_guard_disposable_signup`).

## 5. Fraud & anomaly detection
- `fn_fraud_scan` (daily `fraud_scan_daily`) → `fraud_flags` (kind/severity/status) over the
  knowledge graph + price benchmarks + behavioural patterns.
- `fn_exception_alerts` (hourly) → `founder_alerts` for anomalies.
- **Canaries/honeytokens:** `canary_records` + `canary_scan` detect data exfiltration
  (planted rows, honeytoken emails).

## 6. File & content safety
- **VirusTotal:** every uploaded file scanned (`vt_scan`, `fn_run_vt`, `vt_results`,
  `virustotal_api_key`, daily `vt_scan_daily`).
- **Contact-leak prevention:** quotes/chat scrubbed of contact info (`mask_contacts`,
  `scrub_quote_contacts`, `quote_leak_guard`); chat monitored (`chat_violations`, strikes, bans).

## 7. Audit & reversibility
- `decision_log` — **append-only** (enforced by `trg_declog_immutable`) record of every decision.
- `agent_action_log`, `agent_command_log` — full agent action/command trail.
- `undo_log` — before-images enabling safe reversal.
- `security_events` (18) / `error_events` (309) — security & error telemetry.
- `doc_versions`, `kb_revisions`, RFQ/quote versioning triggers — tamper-evident change history.

## 8. Privacy / compliance (UAE PDPL)
- `pdpl_requests` + `pdpl_request` Edge Function handle data-subject access/erasure requests.
- Signed terms captured with IP/version (`signed_terms_*`, `accepted_terms_ip`, `tos_version`).
- `compliance_sources` monitors external regulatory pages for changes (signature diffing).

## 9. Secrets management
All third-party credentials live in `app_secrets` (Stripe, Twilio, Resend, Postiz, Dropbox, Gemini,
OpenRouter, Apify, VirusTotal, Vercel, Meta) and `supabase_vault`; read only by service-role Edge
Functions. Webhooks verify signatures (`stripe_webhook_secret`, `resend_webhook_key`,
`inbound_webhook_secret`, `content_secret`, `inbound_secret`).

## 10. Reliability as security
Uptime probes (`health_checks`, 15-min), smoke tests (30-min), daily money-path tests
(`money_tests`), daily QA suite (`qa_results`), weekly backups, and monthly DR restore drills
(`dr_drill`, `dr_restore`) protect availability and data integrity.

## 11. Known gaps — RESOLVED 2026-07-06 (see OPEN_ISSUES.md)
The source read found two **unauthenticated Edge Functions** and a broken suppression write. All
fixed the same day:
- **`match`** (now v2) — gated with `inbound_secret` OR signed-in user.
- **`reembed_suppliers`** (now v2) — gated with `inbound_secret`.
- **`resend_webhook`** (now v3) — was writing to a non-existent `email_suppression` (singular), so
  bounce/complaint suppression silently failed; now writes `email_suppressions` (plural).

Remaining design considerations (not bugs) are tracked in `OPEN_ISSUES.md`: the shared
`inbound_secret`, and the `customer_api.confirm_reveal` stub path.

Note on the auth boundary: most functions set `verify_jwt:false` and enforce auth **in code**
(`getUser` + role / `inbound_secret` / webhook signature). The platform JWT flag is therefore not
the security boundary — the in-code check is. Every new function must implement its own gate.

> Any change to roles, gates, RLS, or secrets handling must be recorded here and in `DECISIONS.md`.
'),
('_global','Asset text: EDGE_FUNCTIONS_REFERENCE.md',45,'From company asset "EDGE_FUNCTIONS_REFERENCE.md" (Dropbox: /QuotesDone Backup/Assets/QuotesDone_OS_Docs/EDGE_FUNCTIONS_REFERENCE.md)

# EDGE_FUNCTIONS_REFERENCE

Complete per-function reference, read from source 2026-07-06. Covers the ~109 business functions
(the remaining ~38 are page-servers and `tmp_*`/`asset_*`/debug utilities, listed at the end).
Companion to `EDGE_FUNCTIONS.md` (grouped overview). Auth legend: **secret** = `body.__secret ==
app_secrets.inbound_secret`; **JWT** = Supabase token; **admin** = JWT email in `admin_emails`;
**MFA** = `admin_mfa_sessions`. LLM = OpenRouter unless noted; standard ladder is
`claude-opus-4.8 → sonnet-4.6 → gpt-4o` (utility gen adds `gemini-2.0-flash-001`).

---

## Core surfaces (read in full earlier)

- **os** — serves `/os` HTML from `pages`. Public.
- **os_api** (v2) — JWT+admin. Action router → `fn_os_command/fn_os_nav/fn_ws_*/fn_os_search/
  fn_os_record`. Actions: ping, dashboard, nav, ws.*, search, record.
- **customer_api** (v22) — JWT (auto-creates customer). 14 actions: me, specs, detect,
  analyze_drawing (→cad_convert/drawing_boq/drawing_redact), analyze_quotation (→quote_extract),
  create_inquiry (20/hr; →route_inquiry; queues notifs), my_inquiries, quote_pdf (40/hr; →pdf_native;
  Arabic via OpenRouter; cached), reveal, confirm_reveal, request_refund, rate_supplier, complete/
  close/cancel_inquiry, supplier_history, save_me.
- **inquiry_ai** (v17) — JWT, 30/hr. Two-stage RFQ brain (sourcing brief → category-expert estimator
  gate). Multimodal. Anonymity + UAE-compliance clauses. Returns structured brief + questions.
- **route_inquiry** (v4) — secret. Hybrid retrieval (gte-small vector + kw RPCs) → ≤40 approved →
  LLM fit adjudication (single/multi-trade). Returns genuine fits or zero.
- **agent_act** (v14) — secret OR admin+MFA. `chat` proposes 1 of 11 whitelisted actions; `confirm`
  executes. Postiz/Meta/approve-supplier/etc. Human confirms everything.
- **stripe_webhook** (v1) — Stripe HMAC. `checkout.session.completed` → creates transaction, flips
  to revealed, notifies supplier.

---

## Supply side & quote pipeline

- **supplier_api** (v17) — supplier JWT. Actions: me, search, create_company, claim, process_docs
  (→license_extract), save_profile (→profile_ai), pay_registration, dashboard, inbox, projects,
  extract_quote (→quote_extract), submit_quote (→supplier_review). Gates submit on
  approval+terms+registration. Buckets: supplier-docs, quote-files, drawing-files.
- **supplier_me** (v1) — supplier JWT. Read-only own digital twin (`supplier_twin`),
  `supplier_reputation`, and 30-day RFQ exposure (matched vs not).
- **supplier_ack** (v1) — public token (`tx`+`ack_token`). One-click "I contacted the customer"
  landing → sets `transactions.supplier_ack_at`, stops nudges.
- **supplier_review** (v1) — secret. AI data-quality reviewer of a registration before human review
  (sonnet-4.6). Returns severity clean/minor/review. Fails open. No writes.
- **profile_ai** (v4) — secret/`__test`. Enriches supplier profile from email text+images
  (sonnet-4.6 → gpt-4o → gemini). Normalizes emirates/category. No writes (caller persists).
- **match** (v2) — secret OR signed-in user (gated 2026-07-06). Keyword/category/emirate matcher via
  `match_suppliers_kw`. Read-only.
- **quote_ai** (v2) — supplier JWT, 30/hr (`ai_usage`). Converts supplier quote text/images →
  anonymized marketplace quote (masks identity+brands; regex scrub + sonnet-4.6). No persist.
- **quote_compare** (v9) — customer JWT / admin / secret. Expert plain-language comparison of a
  customer''s anonymized quotes with ranked top-3 (opus-4.8 ladder). Optional Arabic. Read-only.
- **quote_review** (v1) — secret. AI quote-auditor engine: turns extracted quote into binding
  line-item spec via supplier Q&A; handles outsourced lines + markup. Used by quote_review_api.
- **quote_review_api** (v1) — supplier JWT. Actions: get, start, reply, submit. Drives the blocking
  quote-detailing session; `submit` gated on approval+complete+confirmed items; freezes
  `committed_hash`, writes final quote, marks inquiry `quoted`, notifies customer.
- **quote_quality** (v1) — customer JWT. Read-only completeness/quality badge for own quotes.
- **quote_extract** (v3) — secret. Reads supplier quotation (images/PDF) → anonymized standardized
  quote (masks identity+brand/model; sonnet-4.6 → gpt-4o → gemini). No writes.
- **drawing_boq** (v8) — secret. UAE-QS agent: reads drawings → privacy-scrubbed draft BOQ
  (16-category taxonomy; vision LLM). No writes.
- **drawing_redact** (v3) — secret. Detects+blacks out identifying regions on drawing pages
  (vision LLM + imagescript). Fail-closed (skips pages it can''t safely redact). Writes to
  drawing-files. Returns paths.
- **cad_convert** (v4) — secret. DWG/DXF → PNG via **CloudConvert** (200 DPI). Base64 images out.
- **extract_text** (v1) — admin/secret. PDF/image → faithful text/markdown for the Secretary
  (opus-4.8 → gpt-4o → gemini; PDF via file-parser). Capped 16k chars.
- **license_extract** (v1) — secret. Vision extractor: `license` mode (trade-licence fields) /
  `profile` mode (company profile). Normalizes dates/emirate/TRN. No writes.
- **doc_extract** (v1) — secret. Universal doc-intelligence: drains `documents` (status pending) →
  extracts specs/brands/etc. (sonnet-4.6/gpt-4o; unpdf); indexes only catalog/profile/drawing kinds
  into `kb_chunks` (quotes/licences excluded as PII). Updates `documents.status`.

## Admin / CRM / auth / disputes

- **admin_api** (v17) — admin JWT (no secret path). ~35 actions: overview, agents_overview/history/
  chat, content_drafts, outreach/bd_set, collections/mark_due_paid, chats, inquiries, revenue,
  refunds/approve_refund/reject_refund, suppliers/review_queue/kyc, verify/approve/reject_supplier,
  unban, resolve_review, agent_queue/agent_decide, crm, agent_activity, finance/add|update|
  delete_expense, log_usage, run_finance, run_agent. RPCs: registered_supplier_count, run_agent,
  fn_founder_brief, fn_security_scan, fn_doc_control, fn_collections. LLM sonnet-4.6. USD→AED 3.6725.
- **admin_detail** (v3) — admin/secret. team_feed, recent_inquiries, inquiry_detail, quote_detail,
  pending_approvals, approve/reject. Signs drawing/doc URLs (1h). Quotes anonymized "Supplier N".
- **admin_provision** (v1) — secret only. Create/reset a Supabase auth user (RPC auth_uid_by_email).
- **crm_api** (v6) — admin/secret; **JWT admins require SMS MFA** (Twilio Verify). Actions:
  mfa_status/start/verify, dashboard, agents_pending, agent_action, agent_runs_recent, tasks_list/
  add/done, list_suppliers/customers/deals, *_detail, note_add, disputes_list/refund_decide,
  chats_list/chat_decide, supplier_op/customer_op/bulk (≤200), meta. MFA session 12h. Notifies on
  approve/reject/ban; refund emails customer; opening chat emails both parties.
- **crm_pipeline** (v3) — admin/secret; MFA except meta/stages/lost_reasons. Kanban board, stage
  moves (won→completed, lost→cancelled + logs activity), pipeline_report, deal_update, activity_*.
  Views crm_stages/crm_deal_kpis/crm_pipeline_report; tables crm_activities/lost_reasons.
- **dispute_api** (v3) — customer/admin JWT. status, request (72h window), admin_list, admin_resolve,
  funnel (RPC funnel_metrics), suppliers_pending, supplier_decision. Queues notifs.
- **messages_api** (v4) — customer/supplier JWT; chat only on revealed transactions. Actions:
  threads, request_chat, thread, send. **Hard contact-leak detection** (email/link/UAE mobile/
  messaging app) → blocks message, **auto-bans**, closes thread, alerts owner (AED 10,000 penalty);
  borderline held for review. Uses LLM triage (sonnet-4.6→gpt-4o→gemini→llama-3.3-70b).
- **qa_api** (v1) — customer/supplier JWT. Anonymized pre-reveal Q&A (regex strips contacts); max 3
  questions/customer/supplier; blocked after reveal.
- **doc_review_api** (v1) — admin JWT. queue/approve/reject AI-classified inbound supplier docs;
  approve maps ai_category → lead doc columns. B'),
